/// The minimal game: a Z80 binary loaded at 0x8000 (32768). Fable-clean:
/// no I/O, no GUI — only the CE program and its two interpretations
/// (assembled bytes + direct execution). Any WPF or Fable shell can
/// reference this project.
module MinimalGame.Game

open Jetpac2.Core
open Jetpac2.Core.Z80BuilderInstance

/// The game image: proba.bin (397 bytes), a Z80 program that runs at
